@page "/about"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>關於 EasyLottery</PageTitle>

<section class="page-shell about-page" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="page-heading">
        <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">EASYLOTTERY</p>
            <h1 id="about-title">關於 EasyLottery</h1>
            <p class="page-lead">把直播互動、抽獎活動與 OBS 呈現集中在同一個工作流程。</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-grid">
        <article class="about-card">
            <span class="about-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
            <h2>為直播而設計</h2>
            <p>用 Donate、戳戳樂、轉盤與加班台建立可重複使用的直播互動體驗。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="about-card">
            <span class="about-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">▣</span>
            <h2>OBS 友善</h2>
            <p>每個呈現畫面都能以透明背景嵌入 OBS，並可用專屬網址隔離不同活動。</p>
        </article>
        <article class="about-card">
            <span class="about-card-icon" aria-hidden="true">◈</span>
            <h2>可控且可追溯</h2>
            <p>活動設定、抽獎結果與稽核紀錄分離保存，方便管理、備份與日後擴充。</p>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-page {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 1.25rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
    }

    .about-card {
        min-height: 12rem;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        background: var(--el-surface-strong);
        border: 1px solid var(--el-border);
        border-radius: 1rem;
        box-shadow: var(--el-shadow);
    }

    .about-card-icon {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        width: 2.5rem;
        height: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        color: var(--el-accent);
        background: var(--el-surface-soft);
        border-radius: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
    }

    .about-card h2 {
        margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .about-card p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--el-text-muted);
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    @@media (max-width: 768px) {
        .about-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
